{"title":"I Became The First Prince","synopsis":"Hidup ratusan tahun setelah bereinkarnasi menjadi pedang, aku menghabiskan seumur hidup hanya membereskan urusan orang lain.\n\nLalu tiba-tiba—aku merebut tubuh seorang pangeran pertama berandalan berusia lima belas tahun.\n\n“Berapa banyak anak yang sudah kubesarkan, coba.”\n\nKsatria agung yang dijuluki tidak terkalahkan, Dragon Slayer yang menumbangkan Naga Gila, Raja Tentara Bayaran—\n\nsemuanya adalah hasil didikanku.\n\nIblis Pedang Gruhon, yang merasuki tubuh pangeran pertama berandalan,\n\ndan mitos baru yang ia ukir kembali.","alternative_title":"망나니 1왕자가 되었다","author":"Menyusul","artist":"Menyusul","genres":["Action"],"chapters":[{"id":"2f7797c0-101f-4915-9432-039c5926a9d4","number":"46","title":"Chapter 46","date":"2026-07-28","images":[]},{"id":"a0ae8021-e4db-48c0-9dd5-9334c358ee45","number":"45","title":"Chapter 45","date":"2026-07-21","images":[]},{"id":"7eea5c34-1bec-4f5c-8ac3-a6930ed0b0f9","number":"44","title":"Chapter 44","date":"2026-07-14","images":[]},{"id":"496f41c9-3b62-4406-ac0f-46af333472a8","number":"43","title":"Chapter 43","date":"2026-07-07","images":[]},{"id":"7258fd10-4784-4058-81b0-a10dab9ee2a8","number":"42","title":"Chapter 42","date":"2026-06-30","images":[]},{"id":"9bff5476-ee8a-408e-9aa4-6568bc3655fc","number":"41","title":"Chapter 41","date":"2026-06-23","images":[]},{"id":"027109af-b9f2-4e95-afe0-640b01223a84","number":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2026-06-16","images":[]},{"id":"c97ea5cd-89ae-4c09-8660-397fb85f385b","number":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2026-06-09","images":[]},{"id":"ceaa00fb-10c9-474f-a12b-a4714fc7af58","number":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2026-06-02","images":[]},{"id":"076dd0c9-fc9f-4469-90a7-95341d5c1abb","number":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2026-05-26","images":[]},{"id":"69405e1d-1308-4d03-88b3-27cd70e114fe","number":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2026-05-19","images":[]},{"id":"8cd02690-f9eb-4f23-b841-788a6c476fc1","number":"35","